  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2502.02 Tinted Strip on Windshield",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2502.02 Tinted Strip on Windshield. Pursuant to RSA 266:58-a, V, a strip of after market tinting shall not be prohibited as long as the strip:\n\n(a) Is not wider than 6 inches; and\n\n(b) Has a light transmittance of not less than 35 percent.\n\nSource. #4974, eff 11-13-90; ss by #6204, eff 3-15-96, EXPIRED: 3-15-04\n\nNew. #8072, eff 4-23-04; ss by #10083, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13416, eff 7-25-22; ss by #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
